# Copy to .env.local and fill in.
#
# An Imgur Client-ID, for uploading pictures from the device. Register one at
# https://api.imgur.com/oauth2/addclient, choosing "Anonymous usage without
# user authorisation". It takes about a minute and needs no callback URL.
#
# This is a PUBLIC identifier. Imgur intends it to be sent from a browser, so
# it ends up in the built bundle and that is fine. What it is not is a secret:
# anyone can read it and spend the daily anonymous quota attached to it. If
# that happens, register a new one and rebuild.
#
# Leave it unset and the upload button simply is not shown. Pasting an image
# address keeps working, which is how the gallery was built in the first place.
VITE_IMGUR_CLIENT_ID=
